{"_path":"/book/stm32","_dir":"book","_draft":false,"_partial":false,"_locale":"","title":"STM32","description":"","director":"My","time":"2026.05.15","img":"stm32/1.png","plan":"100,100","body":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tag":"book-content","props":{":by":"director",":img":"img",":plan":"plan",":title":"title"},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"text-title","props":{":t":"为什么想学 STM32"},"children":[]},{"type":"element","tag":"h1","props":{"id":"为什么学-stm32-1","data-toc-marker":"true","data-toc-count":"1","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"为什么学 STM32 1"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"text-space","props":{"type":"tip"},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"现在我才知道那种包着硬件的灰色透明塑胶袋，实际上叫 ESD静电保护袋抗静电袋（Electrostatic Discharge Bag，简称 ESD Bag）是一种专门设计用来防止静电累积与静电放电的包装材料，主要应用于电子元件、半导体、PCB、感测器、精密零组件等对静电敏感的产品。"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"在此之前我完全不知道 STM32 是什么，只是在 X 上刷到了很多硬件的分享帖子。同时感觉只会写软件太局限了，接触点硬件也很不错。于是在朋友的推荐下买了 STM32。在购买的时候遇到了一个有趣的事情，由于我是在咸鱼买的二手 STM32 套件，刚好是江协的，价格刚好是 32, 拿到货之后很新，就拆了几个，但 STM32 没有拆，还是那个灰色的透明塑封包着的。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"而且这个包装特别自信，二维码就是 STM32 入门套件，一扫就跳到 bing，第一个就是江协的 CSDN，然后官网直接跳转到视频，视频课程还有百度网盘的下载链接（很 low，为什么不做成在线的文档，一种很老的气息扑面而来）而且还有 2475.4万 的播放量。这说明这个行业很卷，很多人。"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"text-space","props":{"type":"tip"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"element","tag":"table","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"thead","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"th","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"半导体产业链核心环节"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"th","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"主要内容/企业举例"}]}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"tbody","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"上游支撑"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"材料：硅片、电子特气、光刻胶"},{"type":"element","tag":"br","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"text","value":"设备：光刻机、刻蚀机等"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"中游制造"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"芯片设计：高通、英伟达等"},{"type":"element","tag":"br","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"text","value":"晶圆代工：台积电、中芯国际等"},{"type":"element","tag":"br","props":{},"children":[]},{"type":"text","value":"芯片封测：日月光、长电科技等"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"下游应用"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"消费电子、智能手机、汽车电子、AI算力、工业制造等"}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"p","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"拿到手之后，我看到了 STM32 的芯片，其他的大差不差。我比较好奇这些丝印具体代表什么，于是整理了一个对照表："}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"},{"type":"element","tag":"table","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"thead","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"th","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"标记"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"th","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"对应含义"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"th","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"补充说明"}]}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"tbody","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"tr","props":{},"children":[{"type":"element","tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"ST"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"STMicroelectronics（意法半导体）厂牌标识"}]},{"type":"element","tag":"td","props":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"表示芯片品牌/厂商来源。"}]}]},{"type":"element","tag":"tr","props":{},"child